><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.555em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.61em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.555em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.055em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.055em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.055em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.055em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.055em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.055em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.055em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.555em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[27]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{frame map t\\_k\\^{}\\{G\\_c\\}(u) R == R t\\_k\\^{}Lambda(u), k = 1,2,3, u = 3/10 (exact)} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{<0|\\_Lambda = (e1 e4 e1 e4) R == lambda x 1 x lambda x 1 (exact)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{R\\^{}\\{-1\\}|0bar>\\_c == 1 x lambda x 1 x lambda (exact)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{u-derivative vs central difference (rel., k = 1,2,3)} & \\left\\{4.73\\times 10^{-10},8.66\\times 10^{-10},9.33\\times 10^{-10}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{vector propagation == explicit matrices: \\{k, ket, bra\\}} & \\begin{pmatrix}1 & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\2 & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\3 & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{time of the frame-map block (s), memory (GB)} & \\left\\{15.9518025,0.8762466240000001\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "07cc4b19-8a2e-4e35-aa46-0dcf19bce3ef"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Part 1. Three exact ingredients at finite twist\n\n### 1(a). The pair $\\kappa$-family  $\\langle W_a^L|K_\\kappa=(1-\\kappa z_1)^2\\,\\langle W_{a'}\\otimes W_a^{L-1}|$,  $a'=a\\,\\dfrac{1-\\kappa z_4}{1-\\kappa z_1}$\n\nStatement (status note §4, `pair-group-rotation.wb`). At the ABJM point (pair-by-pair $\\theta=(\\theta_{F1}+2h,\\theta_{F1},\\theta_{F2}+2h,\\theta_{F2})$) and for a twist with $z_2=z_3=y$, the five localised pair words $\\{1,X_1,X_2,X_3,X_3X_1\\}$, $X_1=t_1(\\theta_{F1})$, $X_2=t_2(\\theta_{F1}+h)$, $X_3=\\hat t_3(\\theta_{F1}+h)$, combine to\n$$K_\\kappa=s^2+\\kappa s\\Big(\\tfrac{X_1}{h^2\\lambda_1}+\\tfrac{X_2}{2h^4y\\lambda_2}+\\tfrac{X_3}{6h^5y^2\\lambda_3}\\Big)+\\kappa^2\\tfrac{X_3X_1}{24h^7y^2\\lambda_1\\lambda_3},\\qquad s=1-\\kappa(z_1+z_4),$$\nwhere $\\lambda_k$ are the localisation constants of the remaining pairs. This is a statement about bras in the diagonal frame; $a$ drops out of the coefficients. Control: for $z_2\\ne z_3$ the cyclic space of $W_a$ on the pair is 6-dimensional against 5 localised directions, so the identity must fail.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 1(a): <W_a^L| K_kappa == (1 - kappa z1)^2 <W_a' x W_a^{L-1}|, L = 2, exact, ABJM pair-by-pair theta *)\nqfLamK[k_, u_, thA_List, thF_List] := Times @@ DeleteCases[Flatten[Table[Join[Table[u - thA[[n]] - j 1/2, {j, 0, k - 1}], {u - thF[[n]] - k/2}, Table[u - thF[[n]] - j/2, {j, 0, k - 2}]], {n, Length[thA]}]], 0];  (* pairs 2..L; h = 1/2 *)\nqfKbra[ref_, z_, kap_, y_, thF_, h_] := Module[{ty = {\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"}, thA = thF + 2 h, th, G = DiagonalMatrix[z], u1, u2, l1, l2, l3, x1, x2, x3, x31, s = 1 - kap (z[[1]] + z[[4]]), t1m, t2m, t3m},\n   th = {thA[[1]], thF[[1]], thA[[2]], thF[[2]]}; u1 = thF[[1]]; u2 = thF[[1]] + h;\n   l1 = qfLamK[1, u1, Rest[thA], Rest[thF]]; l2 = qfLamK[2, u2, Rest[thA], Rest[thF]]; l3 = qfLamK[3, u2, Rest[thA], Rest[thF]];\n   t1m = qfT[1, G, u1, ty, th, h]; t2m = qfT[2, G, u2, ty, th, h]; t3m = qfT[3, G, u2, ty, th, h, True];\n   x1 = ref . t1m; x2 = ref . t2m; x3 = ref . t3m; x31 = x3 . t1m;\n   s^2 ref + kap s (x1/(h^2 l1) + x2/(2 h^4 y l2) + x3/(6 h^5 y^2 l3)) + kap^2 x31/(24 h^7 y^2 l1 l3)];\nqfP1a = Module[{h = 1/2, thF = {-3/5, -11/8}, z = {3/2, 5/4, 5/4, 4/7}, zc = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3, 4/7}, rows, ctrl},\n  rows = Flatten[Table[Module[{ref = qfWbra[{a, a}], kw, ap, tgt},\n      kw = qfKbra[ref, z, kap, z[[2]], thF, h]; ap = a (1 - kap z[[4]])/(1 - kap z[[1]]);\n      tgt = (1 - kap z[[1]])^2 qfWbra[{ap, a}];\n      {a, kap, ap, kw === tgt}], {a, {1/3, -1}}, {kap, {3/10, -7/5, 1/z[[4]]}}], 1];\n  ctrl = Module[{a = 1/3, kap = 3/10, ref, kw, ap, tgt}, ref = qfWbra[{a, a}]; kw = qfKbra[ref, zc, kap, (zc[[2]] + zc[[3]])/2, thF, h]; ap = a (1 - kap zc[[4]])/(1 - kap zc[[1]]); tgt = (1 - kap zc[[1]])^2 qfWbra[{ap, a}];\n     N[Norm[kw - tgt]/Norm[tgt], 4]];\n  <|\"rows\" -> rows, \"ctrl\" -> ctrl|>];\nGrid[Join[{{\"a\", \"kappa\", \"a' = a(1-kappa z4)/(1-kappa z1)\", \"<W_a^2|K_kappa == (1-kappa z1)^2 <W_a' x W_a| (exact, z2 = z3 = 5/4)\"}}, qfP1a[\"rows\"], {{\"control z2 != z3 (z = (3/2,5/4,2/3,4/7), y = (z2+z3)/2): relative residual\", \"\", \"\", qfP1a[\"ctrl\"]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
