  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 1(b) [hp 40 digits; exact in the Möbius map]:** in all five sectors $(\\mu,0,0,-\\mu)$ (1, 12, 28, 12, 1 states) and for two values of $(w_1,w_4)$ the difference $\\langle0_w|\\Psi\\rangle-(v_1u_4)^2\\langle W_a|\\Psi\\rangle$ vanishes to working precision (the overlaps themselves are $O(10^{-3}\\ldots10^{3})$); in the sector $(1,1,-1,-1)$ both vanish, and in $(0,1,0,-1)$ only $\\langle0_w|\\Psi\\rangle$ is non-zero (a weight-$(0,1,0,-1)$ state has an A-site $e_2$ that no F site compensates), so the identity is a statement about $(\\mu,0,0,-\\mu)$ only. The Möbius map $a(w_1)$ is verified symbolically ($u_2=u_3=0$, $v\\cdot u=0$, $a(z_1)=0$, $a(\\infty)=\\kappa_0=-245/76$ at this point). Weight counting makes it $L$-independent.\n\n### 1(c). The $w_1\\to\\infty$ form: an F-only Q-expression with a factorised $B_{z_2}B_{z_3}$\n\nAs $w_1\\to\\infty$, $a\\to\\kappa_0=-\\frac{(z_1-z_2)(z_1-z_3)}{(z_4-z_2)(z_4-z_3)}$ and, in the companion frame, $\\langle0_w|\\to(e_1\\otimes\\tilde u)^{\\otimes L}$, $\\tilde u=e_4^T(G_c-z_2)(G_c-z_3)$: the A sites are those of the SoV vacuum, the F sites are rotated by $f(G_c)=(G_c-z_2)(G_c-z_3)$. With $n=L-\\mu$ for weight $(\\mu,0,0,-\\mu)$ and $\\lambda_1=1/\\prod_{m\\ne1}(z_1-z_m)$, $u_4=(z_4-z_2)(z_4-z_3)$:\n$$\\frac{\\langle W_a^L|\\Psi\\rangle}{\\langle0|\\Psi\\rangle}=\\Big(\\frac a{\\kappa_0}\\Big)^{n}(\\lambda_1u_4)^{-L}\\;B_{z_2}(y)\\,B_{z_3}(y),\\qquad B_z(y)=\\sum_{S\\subseteq\\{F\\}}(-z)^{L-|S|}\\prod_{s<t\\in S}\\frac{\\nu_{st}^2}{\\nu_{st}^2-h^2}\\prod_{s\\in S}y_s ,$$\n$y_s=\\tau_1(\\theta_s)/\\kappa_s$, $\\nu_{st}=\\theta_s-\\theta_t$ on the F sites, and the explicit $\\theta$-products\n$\\kappa_s=h\\prod_{A}(\\pm(\\theta_a-\\theta_s))\\prod_{f\\ne s}(\\pm(\\theta_f-\\theta_s))$ ($+$ if the other site is to the left of $s$, sign reversed if to the right; $\\kappa_2=h\\theta_{12}\\theta_{23}\\theta_{24}$, $\\kappa_4=h\\theta_{14}\\theta_{24}\\theta_{34}$ at $L=2$). *Only eigenvalues $\\tau_1(\\theta_F)$ of the F-site transfer matrices enter the right-hand side* (plus $\\langle0|\\Psi\\rangle$, the SoV normalisation, which is common to both sides). The check below uses $\\langle 0|_\\Lambda=\\lambda\\otimes\\mathbb 1\\otimes\\lambda\\otimes\\mathbb 1$ and 50-digit eigenvectors in all sectors $n=0..4$ at $L=2$, at the generic point and at the ABJM pair-by-pair $\\theta=(2/5,-3/5,-3/8,-11/8)$ (generic $z$, $a=3/7$).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 1(c) L = 2: <W_a|Psi> vs the F-only Q-form with B_{z2} B_{z3}, eigenvalues only on the RHS *)\nqfKappaS[q_, th_, h_] := h Times @@ Table[If[OddQ[a], If[a < q, th[[a]] - th[[q]], th[[q]] - th[[a]]], 1], {a, Length[th]}] Times @@ Table[If[EvenQ[a] && a != q, If[a < q, th[[a]] - th[[q]], th[[q]] - th[[a]]], 1], {a, Length[th]}];\nqfBz[z_, y_List, thF_List, h_] := Module[{L = Length[y], g}, g[i_, j_] := (thF[[i]] - thF[[j]])^2/((thF[[i]] - thF[[j]])^2 - h^2);\n   Sum[(-z)^(L - Length[S]) (Times @@ (g @@@ Subsets[S, {2}])) (Times @@ y[[S]]), {S, Subsets[Range[L]]}]];\nqfKap0[z_] := -((z[[1]] - z[[2]]) (z[[1]] - z[[3]]))/((z[[4]] - z[[2]]) (z[[4]] - z[[3]]));\nqfLam1[z_] := 1/((z[[1]] - z[[2]]) (z[[1]] - z[[3]]) (z[[1]] - z[[4]]));\nqfU4[z_] := (z[[4]] - z[[2]]) (z[[4]] - z[[3]]);\n(* <W_a^L|Psi>/<0|Psi> = (a/kappa0)^n (lam1 u4)^-L B_{z2}(y) B_{z3}(y), y_s = tau_1(theta_{2s})/kappa_s *)\nqfQratio[L_, a_, z_, th_, h_, n_, taus_] := Module[{thF = th[[2 Range[L]]], y = taus/Table[qfKappaS[2 s, th, h], {s, L}]},\n   (a/qfKap0[z])^n (qfLam1[z] qfU4[z])^(-L) qfBz[z[[2]], y, thF, h] qfBz[z[[3]], y, thF, h]];\nqfP1c2 = Module[{h = 1/2, ty = {\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"}, z = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3, 4/7}, a = 3/7, Lam, lamz, bra0, braW, cases},\n  Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z]; lamz = qfLamW[z]; bra0 = qfKron[{lamz, {1, 1, 1, 1}, lamz, {1, 1, 1, 1}}]; braW = qfWbra[{a, a}];\n  cases = {{\"generic theta (2/7,-3/5,8/11,-11/8)\", {2/7, -3/5, 8/11, -11/8}}, {\"ABJM pair-by-pair theta (2/5,-3/5,-3/8,-11/8)\", {2/5, -3/5, -3/8, -11/8}}};\n  Table[Module[{thE = c[[2]], t1m, M, T2, T4, out},\n     t1m[u_] := qfT[1, Lam, u, ty, thE, h];\n     M = t1m[3/11] + 2/5 t1m[-5/7]; T2 = t1m[thE[[2]]]; T4 = t1m[thE[[4]]];\n     out = Table[Module[{idx = qfSector[{2 - nn, 0, 0, nn - 2}, ty], vals, vecs, gap, errs},\n        {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[N[Normal[M[[idx, idx]]], 50]];\n        gap = If[Length[vals] > 1, Min[Abs[Subtract @@@ Subsets[vals, {2}]]], Infinity];\n        errs = Table[Module[{psi = ConstantArray[0, 256], p, tau, lhs, rhs},\n           psi[[idx]] = v; p = First[Ordering[Abs[psi], -1]];\n           tau = {(T2 . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]], (T4 . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]]};\n           lhs = braW . psi; rhs = (bra0 . psi) qfQratio[2, a, z, thE, h, nn, tau];\n           {Abs[lhs - rhs]/Max[Abs[lhs], 10^-30], Abs[lhs]}], {v, vecs}];\n        {nn, Length[idx], N[gap, 3], N[Max[errs[[All, 1]]], 3], N[Max[errs[[All, 2]]], 4]}], {nn, 0, 4}];\n     {c[[1]], out}], {c, cases}]];\nColumn[Table[Grid[Prepend[c[[2]], {\"n = L - mu\", \"# states\", \"min eigenvalue gap\", \"max rel. dev. direct vs Q-form\", \"max |<W_a|Psi>|\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left, Spacings -> {1, 0.5}] // Labeled[#, c[[1]], Top] &, {c, qfP1c2}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
