  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 1(c), $L=2$ [hp 50 digits]:** on all $2\\times54$ eigenstates of the sectors $n=0..4$ (generic and ABJM-pair $\\theta$) the direct $\\langle W_a|\\Psi\\rangle$ equals the F-only Q-form to better than $10^{-41}$ (relative). Right-hand side: the two F-site eigenvalues $\\tau_1(\\theta_2),\\tau_1(\\theta_4)$ and explicit $\\theta,z$-factors.\n\n**$L=3$** (6 sites, vector propagation, never a $4096^2$ matrix). Generic point $\\theta=(2/7,-3/5,8/11,-11/8,5/13,-7/9)$, $z=(3/2,5/4,2/3,4/7)$, $a=3/7$. Sector matrices of $t_1^\\Lambda(1/3)$ are built column by column (exact), a few eigenvectors per sector are refined to 50 digits by inverse iteration, and the three F-site eigenvalues $\\tau_1(\\theta_{2,4,6})$ are read off. Sector $n=2$ (dimension 141) is split over two cells.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 1(c) at L = 3: sectors n = 0 (dim 1) and n = 1 (dim 24) *)\nqfWt6 = Module[{dg = Tuples[Range[4], 6]}, Map[Function[d, Sum[If[OddQ[s], 1, -1] UnitVector[4, d[[s]]], {s, 6}]], dg]];\nqfSec6[w_] := Flatten[Position[qfWt6, w, {1}, Heads -> False]];\nqfSecCols[idx_, u_, types_, th_, h_, Lam_, from_, to_] := Table[qfApplyTk[1, Lam, u, types, th, h, qfUnit[idx[[j]], 4^Length[types]], False, False][[idx]], {j, from, to}];\nqfRefine[M_, x0_, sig_, prec_] := Block[{$MinPrecision = prec, $MaxPrecision = prec}, Module[{d = Length[M], ls, x = SetPrecision[x0, prec]},\n   ls = LinearSolve[SetPrecision[M, prec] - SetPrecision[sig, prec] IdentityMatrix[d]]; Do[x = ls[x]; x = x/Norm[x], {3}]; x]];\nqfL3 = <|\"h\" -> 1/2, \"ty\" -> {\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"}, \"th\" -> {2/7, -3/5, 8/11, -11/8, 5/13, -7/9}, \"z\" -> {3/2, 5/4, 2/3, 4/7}, \"a\" -> 3/7|>;\nqfQcheck3[n_, x_, idx_, a_, th_, z_, h_] := Block[{$MinPrecision = 50, $MaxPrecision = 50}, Module[{ty = qfL3[\"ty\"], Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z], psi = ConstantArray[0, 4096], p, taus, lhs, rhs, lamz = qfLamW[z], bra0},\n   psi[[idx]] = x; p = idx[[First[Ordering[Abs[x], -1]]]];\n   taus = Table[(qfApplyTk[1, Lam, th[[2 s]], ty, th, h, psi, False, False])[[p]]/psi[[p]], {s, 3}];\n   bra0 = qfKron[{lamz, {1, 1, 1, 1}, lamz, {1, 1, 1, 1}, lamz, {1, 1, 1, 1}}];\n   lhs = qfWbra[{a, a, a}] . psi; rhs = (bra0 . psi) qfQratio[3, a, z, th, h, n, taus];\n   {n, N[Abs[lhs], 8], N[Abs[lhs - rhs]/Abs[lhs], 3], N[taus[[1]], 8]}]];\nqfL3Run[n_, M_, idx_, picks_] := Module[{d = Length[M], vals, vecs},\n   {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[N[M]];\n   Table[Module[{x = qfRefine[M, vecs[[j]], vals[[j]], 50], res},\n     res = Block[{$MinPrecision = 50, $MaxPrecision = 50}, Module[{Mx = SetPrecision[M, 50] . x, q = First[Ordering[Abs[x], -1]]}, Norm[Mx - (Mx[[q]]/x[[q]]) x]]];\n     Append[qfQcheck3[n, x, idx, qfL3[\"a\"], qfL3[\"th\"], qfL3[\"z\"], qfL3[\"h\"]], N[res, 3]]], {j, picks}]];\nqfL3t = AbsoluteTiming[\n  qfIdx3 = Association[Table[n -> qfSec6[{3 - n, 0, 0, n - 3}], {n, 0, 2}]];\n  qfM3 = Association[Table[n -> Transpose[qfSecCols[qfIdx3[n], 1/3, qfL3[\"ty\"], qfL3[\"th\"], qfL3[\"h\"], DiagonalMatrix[qfL3[\"z\"]], 1, Length[qfIdx3[n]]]], {n, 0, 1}]];\n  qfL3res01 = Join[qfL3Run[0, qfM3[0], qfIdx3[0], {1}], qfL3Run[1, qfM3[1], qfIdx3[1], {1, 8, 17}]];][[1]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"n\", \"|<W_a^3|Psi>|\", \"rel. dev. direct vs Q-form\", \"tau_1(theta_2)\", \"eigen-residual\"}}, qfL3res01, {{\"sector dims (n=0,1,2); time (s); memory (GB)\", Map[Length, qfIdx3], qfL3t, MemoryInUse[]/10.^9}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<details class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer\">4 warnings</summary><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">N::precsm: Requested precision 8 is smaller than $MinPrecision. Using $MinPrecision instead.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">N::precsm: Requested precision 3 is smaller than $MinPrecision. Using $MinPrecision instead.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">N::precsm: Requested precision 8 is smaller than $MinPrecision. Using $MinPrecision instead.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">General::stop: Further output of N::precsm will be suppressed during this calculation.</div></details>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
