       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"N::precsm: Requested precision 8 is smaller than $MinPrecision. Using $MinPrecision instead.\\nN::precsm: Requested precision 3 is smaller than $MinPrecision. Using $MinPrecision instead.\\nN::precsm: Requested precision 8 is smaller than $MinPrecision. Using $MinPrecision instead.\\nGeneral::stop: Further output of N::precsm will be suppressed during this calculation.\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
