   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 1(c), $L=3$ [hp 50 digits]:** on eigenstates of the sectors $n=0,1,2$ (dimensions 1, 24, 141; 1+3+3 states, spread over each spectrum) the direct $\\langle W_a^3|\\Psi\\rangle$ equals the Q-form (three F-site eigenvalues, $B_{z_2}B_{z_3}$ with the $\\prod\\nu^2/(\\nu^2-h^2)$ pair weights) to the working precision. This is the closed form of the 27 F-only words found by agent D, tested here without ever solving for the words. The general-$L$ proof is open; the formula is exact on the full chain at $L=2,3$ and model-exact at $L=4$ (notes of agent D). The sector $n=3$ (zero weight, dimension 256) was checked in `Wa-Fonly-L6.wb`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Part 2. The assembled formula at the $L=2$ ABJM point\n\n$$|C_{M=1}|=\\lim_{\\varepsilon\\to0}\\;\\mathcal N_{\\rm pre}\\;\\mathbb A\\;\\mathbb W\\;\\frac{|\\langle0|\\Psi\\rangle|}{\\|\\Psi\\|},\\qquad \\mathcal N_{\\rm pre}=\\frac{(a/\\kappa_0)^{n}(\\lambda_1u_4)^{-L}}{(1-\\kappa z_1)^2}\\ (n=L=2),$$\n\n* $\\mathbb A=P_\\kappa(\\tau)=K_\\kappa$ (Part 1(a); single-pair eigenvalues $X_1=\\tau_1(\\theta_{F1})$, $X_2=\\tau_2(u_0)$, $X_3=\\tau_3'(u_0)$, $u_0=\\theta_{F1}+h$);\n* $\\mathbb W=B_{z_2}(y)B_{z_3}(y)$ (Part 1(c); F-site eigenvalues $\\tau_1(\\theta_{F1}),\\tau_1(\\theta_{F2})$);\n* $|\\langle0|\\Psi\\rangle|/\\|\\Psi\\|$ is the SoV normalisation of the (unit-norm) eigenvector, taken **directly from the eigenvector** here. It equals $1/\\sqrt{\\mathbb B}$ up to $H=1+O(\\varepsilon)$, where $\\mathbb B$ is the SoV norm, a bilinear form in Q-data. **$\\mathbb B$ is the known SoV norm in Q-functions (Paul) and is not re-derived here.** (Section 2b below keeps, as a numerical cross-check only, the regularised-basis evaluation $\\mathbb B=\\sum\\tilde\\tau M\\tau$ that had already been run; it is not extended.)\n\nEvery $\\Psi$-dependent input of $\\mathbb A$ and $\\mathbb W$ is an eigenvalue of $t_k(u)$ or $t_k'(u)$ at the pair points; $\\mathcal N_{\\rm pre}$ and all prefactors are explicit functions of $\\theta,z,h$. Chain (unchanged from the sources): $z=1+\\varepsilon\\phi$, $\\phi=(9/10,7/20,3/5,-11/10)$ ($\\phi_2\\ne\\phi_3$ so that the companion frame exists), $\\theta_F=\\varepsilon(0,37/100)$, $\\theta_A=\\theta_F+2h$, $c=3/10$, $\\kappa=1-c\\varepsilon$, $a=(\\phi_1-c)/(\\phi_1-\\phi_4)$, $y=(z_2+z_3)/2$. 90-100 digit eigenvectors of the 28-dimensional zero-weight block in the diagonal frame. The two singlets are tracked by continuity (the real eigenstate whose direct $|C|$ is nearest to $1/\\sqrt{40}$, $1/\\sqrt{24}$; this is only a label). $|C|$ is obtained; the sign is the phase of $\\Psi$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ===== Part 2 machinery, L = 2 ABJM epsilon-chain. No memoisation; data stores are plain assignments. ===== *)\nqfPhi = {9/10, 7/20, 3/5, -11/10}; qfThdir = {0, 37/100}; qfCc = 3/10; qfHh = 1/2; qfTy4 = {\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"};\nqfZero = qfSector[{0, 0, 0, 0}, qfTy4]; qfLabels = Tuples[Range[0, 3], 4];\nqfSetup[eps_] := Module[{h = qfHh, z = 1 + eps qfPhi, thF = eps qfThdir, thA, th, kap, a},\n   thA = thF + 2 h; th = {thA[[1]], thF[[1]], thA[[2]], thF[[2]]}; kap = 1 - qfCc eps; a = (qfPhi[[1]] - qfCc)/(qfPhi[[1]] - qfPhi[[4]]);\n   <|\"eps\" -> eps, \"z\" -> z, \"thF\" -> thF, \"thA\" -> thA, \"th\" -> th, \"kap\" -> kap, \"a\" -> a, \"y\" -> (z[[2]] + z[[3]])/2, \"s\" -> 1 - kap (z[[1]] + z[[4]]),\n     \"Nk\" -> (1 - kap z[[1]])^2, \"kap0\" -> qfKap0[z], \"lam1\" -> qfLam1[z], \"u4\" -> qfU4[z], \"lamz\" -> qfLamW[z], \"nu\" -> thF[[1]] - thF[[2]]|>];\n(* one monodromy build per (k,u), contracted with several twists; wantD adds the exact u-derivative *)\nqfTmulti[k_, Gs_List, u_, types_, th_, h_, wantD_] := Module[{TT = qfMono[k, u, types, th, h, wantD], p = qfGpref[k, u, types, th, h, False], pp},\n   pp = If[wantD, qfGprefD[k, u, types, th, h], 0];\n   Table[If[wantD, Module[{tb = qfContract[TT[[1]], k, G], tbp = qfContract[TT[[2]], k, G]}, {p tb, p tbp + pp tb}], p qfContract[TT, k, G]], {G, Gs}]];\n(* all operators of pair p: companion-frame composites (for the Gram matrix) and diagonal-frame zero-weight blocks (for the eigenvalue data) *)\nqfPairBuild[S_, p_] := Module[{h = qfHh, Gs = {DiagonalMatrix[S[\"z\"]], qfGc[S[\"z\"]]}, th = S[\"th\"], ty = qfTy4, thF = S[\"thF\"][[p]], thA = S[\"thA\"][[p]], u0, F, A, T1, T2, T3, T2A, T3A, zq, blk, comp, ident},\n   u0 = thF + h; zq[m_] := Max[Abs[Flatten[Normal[m]]]] == 0;\n   F = qfTmulti[1, Gs, thF, ty, th, h, False]; A = qfTmulti[1, Gs, thA, ty, th, h, False];\n   T1 = qfTmulti[1, Gs, u0, ty, th, h, True]; T2 = qfTmulti[2, Gs, u0, ty, th, h, True]; T3 = qfTmulti[3, Gs, u0, ty, th, h, True];\n   T2A = qfTmulti[2, Gs, thA, ty, th, h, True]; T3A = qfTmulti[3, Gs, thA + h, ty, th, h, True];\n   blk[m_] := Normal[m[[qfZero, qfZero]]];\n   comp = <|\"F\" -> F[[2]], \"A\" -> A[[2]], \"t1u\" -> T1[[2, 1]], \"W\" -> T2[[2, 2]] - T1[[2, 2]] . F[[2]], \"Z\" -> T3[[2, 2]], \"t2u\" -> T2[[2, 1]], \"Wt\" -> T2A[[2, 2]] - A[[2]] . T1[[2, 2]], \"Zt\" -> T3A[[2, 2]]|>;\n   ident = {zq[T3[[2, 1]]], zq[T2[[2, 1]] - T1[[2, 1]] . F[[2]]], zq[T2A[[2, 1]] - A[[2]] . T1[[2, 1]]], zq[T3A[[2, 1]]]};\n   <|\"comp\" -> comp, \"ident\" -> ident, \"blk\" -> <|\"F\" -> blk[F[[1]]], \"A\" -> blk[A[[1]]], \"t1u\" -> blk[T1[[1, 1]]], \"d1u\" -> blk[T1[[1, 2]]], \"t2u\" -> blk[T2[[1, 1]]], \"d2u\" -> blk[T2[[1, 2]]], \"d3u\" -> blk[T3[[1, 2]]], \"d2A\" -> blk[T2A[[1, 2]]], \"d3A\" -> blk[T3A[[1, 2]]]|>|>];\nqfCombBlk[S_] := Module[{Lam = DiagonalMatrix[S[\"z\"]], th = S[\"th\"], h = qfHh, t1, t3, t2},\n   t1 = qfTmulti[1, {Lam}, 3/11, qfTy4, th, h, False][[1]]; t3 = qfTmulti[3, {Lam}, -5/7, qfTy4, th, h, False][[1]]; t2 = qfTmulti[2, {Lam}, 2/9, qfTy4, th, h, False][[1]];\n   Normal[(t1 + 7/10 t3 - 3/13 t2)[[qfZero, qfZero]]]];\n(* SoV words: bra <0| O_{a1} F^{k2} O'_{a3} F'^{k4} (O23 = t2(u0) for (a,k) = (2,3)); ket words K_{n} A^{m} on |0bar> *)\nqfBraRow[ops_, vac_, {a1_, k2_, a3_, k4_}] := Module[{v = vac}, Do[Module[{a = {a1, a3}[[p]], k = {k2, k4}[[p]]}, If[a > 0, v = v . If[a == 2 && k == 3, ops[\"O23\"][[p]], ops[\"O\"][[p, a]]]]; Do[v = v . ops[\"F\"][[p]], {k}]], {p, 1, 2}]; v];\nqfKetCol[ops_, ket0_, {m1_, n2_, m3_, n4_}] := Module[{v = ket0}, Do[Module[{m = {m1, m3}[[p]], n = {n2, n4}[[p]]}, If[n > 0, v = ops[\"K\"][[p, n]] . v]; Do[v = ops[\"A\"][[p]] . v, {m}]], {p, {2, 1}}]; v];\nqfGramOps[P1_, P2_] := <|\"F\" -> {P1[\"comp\"][\"F\"], P2[\"comp\"][\"F\"]}, \"A\" -> {P1[\"comp\"][\"A\"], P2[\"comp\"][\"A\"]}, \"O\" -> {{P1[\"comp\"][\"t1u\"], P1[\"comp\"][\"W\"], P1[\"comp\"][\"Z\"]}, {P2[\"comp\"][\"t1u\"], P2[\"comp\"][\"W\"], P2[\"comp\"][\"Z\"]}},\n   \"O23\" -> {P1[\"comp\"][\"t2u\"], P2[\"comp\"][\"t2u\"]}, \"K\" -> {{P1[\"comp\"][\"t1u\"], P1[\"comp\"][\"Wt\"], P1[\"comp\"][\"Zt\"]}, {P2[\"comp\"][\"t1u\"], P2[\"comp\"][\"Wt\"], P2[\"comp\"][\"Zt\"]}}|>;\n{\"Part 2 machinery loaded\", N[MemoryInUse[]/10.^9, 3]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
