      {
       "data": "Out[114]= \\begin{matrix}\\begin{matrix}\\text{singlet E = 20 (target 1/sqrt(40))}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{eps} & \\text{|C\\_direct| = |K <W\\_a|Psi>/N|} & \\text{|C\\_Q| = N\\_pre|A||W||<0|Psi>|} & \\text{|<W|Psi>\\_direct - <W|Psi>\\_Q|/|<W|Psi>|} & \\text{|A|} & \\text{|W|} & \\text{|<0|Psi>|/||Psi||} & \\text{N\\_pre}\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{100} & 0.157956610596 & 0.157956610596 & 0.\\times 10^{-73} & 9.699529992 & 25.33182708 & 0.0006370934349 & 1.009061117\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{200} & 0.158035038324 & 0.158035038324 & 0.\\times 10^{-71} & 9.848638666 & 25.16577039 & 0.0006347612771 & 1.004515233\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{400} & 0.158074407836 & 0.158074407836 & 0.\\times 10^{-79} & 9.924035443 & 25.08284898 & 0.0006336051241 & 1.002253803\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{800} & 0.158094132127 & 0.158094132127 & 0.\\times 10^{-77} & 9.961946458 & 25.04141539 & 0.0006330295106 & 1.001125950\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{1600} & 0.158104004233 & 0.158104004233 & 0.\\times 10^{-85} & 9.980955377 & 25.02070541 & 0.0006327423173 & 1.000562737\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\end{matrix}\\\\\\begin{matrix}\\text{singlet E = 4 (target 1/sqrt(24))}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{eps} & \\text{|C\\_direct| = |K <W\\_a|Psi>/N|} & \\text{|C\\_Q| = N\\_pre|A||W… [latex truncated: 2801 chars total]",
