      {
       "data": "Out[98]= \\begin{matrix}\\begin{matrix}\\text{singlet E = 20 (target 1/sqrt(40))}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{eps} & \\text{|C\\_direct|} & \\text{|C\\_Q|} & \\text{|A| = |P\\_kappa|} & \\text{|W| = |B\\_z2 B\\_z3|} & \\text{|B| = sum tauT M tau} & \\text{N\\_pre}\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{50} & 0.157800959718 & 0.152083131374 & 9.407925300 & 25.66477225 & 2.61339971889\\times 10^{6} & 1.018245949\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{100} & 0.157956610596 & 0.155064907354 & 9.699529992 & 25.33182708 & 2.55647944168\\times 10^{6} & 1.009061117\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{200} & 0.158035038324 & 0.156580874767 & 9.848638666 & 25.16577039 & 2.52818291284\\times 10^{6} & 1.004515233\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{400} & 0.158074407836 & 0.157345233498 & 9.924035443 & 25.08284898 & 2.51407704654\\times 10^{6} & 1.002253803\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{800} & 0.158094132127 & 0.157729019981 & 9.961946458 & 25.04141539 & 2.50703489513\\times 10^{6} & 1.001125950\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{1600} & 0.158104004233 & 0.157921316685 & 9.980955377 & 25.02070541 & 2.50351653734\\times 10^{6} & 1.000562737\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\end{matrix}\\\\\\begin{matrix}\\text{singlet E = 4 (target 1/sqrt(24))}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{eps} & \\text{|C\\_direct|} & \\text{|C\\_Q|} & \\text{|A| = |P… [latex truncated: 2693 chars total]",
