  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 2b [hp 100-120 digits; exact operators, exact Gram; kept from the first pass, not extended]:** (i) $\\mathbb B=\\sum\\tilde\\tau M\\tau$ from eigenvalue data reproduces the direct SoV pairing $\\langle\\Psi^L|\\Psi\\rangle/(\\langle0|\\Psi\\rangle\\langle\\Psi^L|0\\rangle)$ on all 28 zero-weight states at every $\\varepsilon$ (relative errors $10^{-59}\\ldots10^{-45}$, degrading with $\\varepsilon$ as $\\mathrm{Gram}(\\theta_{F1}-\\theta_{F2})$ degenerates); (ii) the exact finite-twist statement is $\\langle0|\\Psi\\rangle^2/\\langle\\Psi^L_*|\\Psi\\rangle=\\lambda^w/\\mathbb B$, while the Euclidean norm differs by $H=1+O(\\varepsilon)$, so $|C_Q(\\varepsilon)|$ approaches $|C_{\\rm direct}(\\varepsilon)|$ only as $\\varepsilon\\to0$ (e.g. $0.1520$ vs $0.1578$ at $\\varepsilon=1/50$); (iii) with the Q-norm the extrapolated limits are $|C_Q|\\to0.158113883008\\ldots=1/\\sqrt{40}$ and $0.204124145232\\ldots=1/\\sqrt{24}$, with $(\\mathbb A,\\mathbb W,\\mathbb B,\\mathcal N_{\\rm pre})\\to(10,25,2\\,500\\,000,1)$ and $(2,9,7776,1)$. Agrees with `abjm-sov-norm-L4.wb` to all printed digits. This section only documents that the known norm $\\mathbb B$ enters as $1/\\sqrt{\\mathbb B}=\\langle0|\\Psi\\rangle/\\|\\Psi\\|$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2c. The $L=3$ ABJM $\\varepsilon$-chain: second table (norm from the eigenvector)\n\nSame formula at $L=3$ (6 sites, vector propagation, sector $(1,0,0,-1)$ of dimension 141 where the six cyclic $[1,0,1]$ highest-weight states of the data live; $n=L-\\mu=2$): $|C|=\\lim\\mathcal N_{\\rm pre}\\,\\mathbb A\\,\\mathbb W\\,|\\langle0|\\Psi\\rangle|/\\|\\Psi\\|$ with $\\mathcal N_{\\rm pre}=(a/\\kappa_0)^2(\\lambda_1u_4)^{-3}/(1-\\kappa z_1)^2$, $\\mathbb A=P_\\kappa$ (pair-1 data $\\tau_1(\\theta_{F1})$, $\\tau_2(u_0)$, $\\hat\\tau_3(u_0)$, localisation constants of pairs 2,3), $\\mathbb W=B_{z_2}B_{z_3}$ with the three F-site eigenvalues. $\\varepsilon=1/100,\\ldots,1/800$, $\\theta_F=\\varepsilon(0,37/100,-52/100)$, 70-digit eigenvectors (selected by projection on the data states of `hw_L3.json`; the pairs 19/20 and 21/22 are complex-conjugate and handled as degenerate groups). The norm $\\langle0|\\Psi\\rangle/\\|\\Psi\\|$ is taken from the eigenvector (the $4096\\times4096$ Gram matrix is not built; the SoV norm $\\mathbb B$ at $L=3$ is the known Q-norm and not rederived).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {
    "toolId": "X62sZmlsZQ"
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 2c: L = 3 epsilon-chain machinery *)\nqfDat3 = Import[\"C:/Users/pryan/git-projects/abjm-c123/Paul/Mathematica/su4-alternating/checks/session-2026-10-13/epsexp/hw_L3.json\", \"RawJSON\"];\nqfTh03 = {0, 37/100, -52/100};\nqfSetup3[eps_] := Module[{h = qfHh, z = 1 + eps qfPhi, thF = eps qfTh03, thA, thE, u0, kap, a, y, s},\n   thA = thF + 2 h; thE = Riffle[thA, thF]; u0 = thF[[1]] + h; kap = 1 - qfCc eps; a = (qfPhi[[1]] - qfCc)/(qfPhi[[1]] - qfPhi[[4]]); y = (z[[2]] + z[[3]])/2; s = 1 - kap (z[[1]] + z[[4]]);\n   <|\"eps\" -> eps, \"z\" -> z, \"thF\" -> thF, \"thA\" -> thA, \"thE\" -> thE, \"u0\" -> u0, \"kap\" -> kap, \"a\" -> a, \"y\" -> y, \"s\" -> s, \"Nk\" -> (1 - kap z[[1]])^2,\n     \"l\" -> {qfLamK[1, thF[[1]], Rest[thA], Rest[thF]], qfLamK[2, u0, Rest[thA], Rest[thF]], qfLamK[3, u0, Rest[thA], Rest[thF]]}, \"lamz\" -> qfLamW[z], \"kap0\" -> qfKap0[z], \"u4\" -> qfU4[z]|>];\nqfM3e = <||>; qfSt3 = <||>; qfOut3 = <||>;\nqfEps3A[eps_] := Module[{S = qfSetup3[eps], t}, t = AbsoluteTiming[qfM3e[eps] = Transpose[qfSecCols[qfIdx3[2], 3/11, qfL3[\"ty\"], S[\"thE\"], qfHh, DiagonalMatrix[S[\"z\"]], 1, 141]];][[1]]; {eps, t, N[MemoryInUse[]/10.^9, 3]}];\nqfEps3B[eps_, prec_] := Module[{M = qfM3e[eps], vals, vecs, idx = qfIdx3[2], picks, groups = {{17}, {18}, {19, 20}, {21, 22}}},\n   {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[N[M]];\n   picks = Flatten[Table[Module[{ps = Table[(qfDat3[\"psiRe\"][[i]] + I qfDat3[\"psiIm\"][[i]])[[idx]], {i, grp}], Q, w, sel}, Q = Orthogonalize[ps]; w = Table[Norm[Conjugate[Q] . vecs[[q]]]/Norm[vecs[[q]]], {q, Length[vecs]}];\n        sel = Take[Ordering[w, -Length[grp]], -Length[grp]]; Table[{grp[[1]], q, w[[q]]}, {q, Reverse[sel]}]], {grp, groups}], 1];\n   qfSt3[eps] = Map[<|\"group\" -> #[[1]], \"ov\" -> #[[3]], \"x\" -> qfRefine[M, vecs[[#[[2]]]], vals[[#[[2]]]], prec]|> &, picks];\n   Map[N[#[[3]], 6] &, picks]];\nqfEps3C[eps_, prec_] := Block[{$MinPrecision = prec, $MaxPrecision = prec}, Module[{S = qfSetup3[eps], h = qfHh, ty = qfL3[\"ty\"], thE, Lam, idx = qfIdx3[2], sts = qfSt3[eps], psis, p, e, bras, br0, brW, u0, rows},\n    thE = S[\"thE\"]; Lam = DiagonalMatrix[S[\"z\"]]; u0 = S[\"u0\"];\n    psis = Table[Module[{ps = ConstantArray[0, 4096]}, ps[[idx]] = st[\"x\"]; ps], {st, sts}];\n    p = First[Ordering[Table[Min[Table[Abs[ps[[idx[[q]]]]], {ps, psis}]], {q, Length[idx]}], -1]]; p = idx[[p]]; e = qfUnit[p, 4096];\n    bras = {qfApplyTk[1, Lam, thE[[2]], ty, thE, h, e, False, True], qfApplyTk[1, Lam, thE[[4]], ty, thE, h, e, False, True], qfApplyTk[1, Lam, thE[[6]], ty, thE, h, e, False, True], qfApplyTk[2, Lam, u0, ty, thE, h, e, False, True], qfApplyTk[3, Lam, u0, ty, thE, h, e, True, True]};\n    br0 = qfKron[{S[\"lamz\"], {1, 1, 1, 1}, S[\"lamz\"], {1, 1, 1, 1}, S[\"lamz\"], {1, 1, 1, 1}}]; brW = qfWbra[{S[\"a\"], S[\"a\"], S[\"a\"]}];\n    rows = Table[Module[{ps = psis[[j]], tau, X1, X2, X3, K, Wv, yv, l = S[\"l\"], kap = S[\"kap\"], y = S[\"y\"], ss = S[\"s\"], ov0, wdir, kapS, Pre0},\n       tau = (bras . ps)/ps[[p]]; X1 = tau[[1]]; X2 = tau[[4]]; X3 = tau[[5]];\n       K = ss^2 + kap ss (X1/(h^2 l[[1]]) + X2/(2 h^4 y l[[2]]) + X3/(6 h^5 y^2 l[[3]])) + kap^2 X3 X1/(24 h^7 y^2 l[[1]] l[[3]]);\n       kapS = Table[qfKappaS[2 q, thE, h], {q, 3}]; yv = tau[[1 ;; 3]]/kapS; Wv = qfBz[S[\"z\"][[2]], yv, S[\"thF\"], h] qfBz[S[\"z\"][[3]], yv, S[\"thF\"], h];\n       Pre0 = (S[\"a\"]/S[\"kap0\"])^2 (S[\"lamz\"][[1]] S[\"u4\"])^(-3); ov0 = (br0 . ps)/Norm[ps]; wdir = (brW . ps)/Norm[ps];\n       <|\"group\" -> sts[[j]][\"group\"], \"Cd\" -> Abs[K wdir/S[\"Nk\"]], \"Cq\" -> Abs[K Pre0 ov0 Wv/S[\"Nk\"]], \"K\" -> K, \"W\" -> Wv, \"ov0\" -> ov0|>], {j, Length[psis]}];\n    qfOut3[eps] = rows; Map[{#[\"group\"], N[Abs[#[\"Cd\"]], 8], N[Abs[#[\"Cq\"] - #[\"Cd\"]]/Abs[#[\"Cd\"]], 3]} &, rows]]];\n{\"2c machinery loaded\", N[MemoryInUse[]/10.^9, 3]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
