pan><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5551em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6102em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.5551em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0551em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.2151em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">y~</span><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> = tau_3’(3/2)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8049em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5551em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6102em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.5551em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0551em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.2151em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tau_3(1/2)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8049em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5551em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6102em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.5551em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.0551em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.0551em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.0551em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.0551em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5551em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[101]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{tau\\_1(0)} & \\text{tau\\_1'(0)} & \\text{tau\\_A = tau\\_1(1)} & \\text{x = tau\\_1(1/2)} & \\text{tau\\_1'(1/2)} & \\text{tau\\_2(1/2)} & \\text{w} & \\text{y = tau\\_3'(1/2)} & \\text{w\\textasciitilde{}} & \\text{y\\textasciitilde{} = tau\\_3'(3/2)} & \\text{tau\\_3(1/2)}\\\\\\hline-\\frac{1}{4} & 1 & -\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{4} & 0 & -\\frac{1}{16} & \\frac{1}{4} & 0 & -\\frac{1}{4} & 0 & 0\\\\\\hline\\frac{1}{4} & 1 & \\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{3}{4} & 0 & \\frac{3}{16} & \\frac{3}{4} & 0 & -\\frac{3}{4} & 0 & 0\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "3b4b29d7-f021-4be9-b63a-2ba16f87e32f"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 3.1 [exact]:** the two untwisted singlets have (per pair) $\\tau_F=\\tau_1(0)=\\mp\\tfrac14$, $\\tau_1'(0)=1$, $x=\\tau_1(\\tfrac12)=\\tfrac14,\\tfrac34$, $\\tau_A=\\tau_F$, $\\tilde w=-w$, and the *plain* derivatives $y=\\tau_3'(u_0)=0=\\tilde y$, $\\tau_3(u_0)=0$. The vanishing of $y,\\tilde y$ is not an accident: at $\\theta_{F1}=\\theta_{F2}$ the polynomial prefactor of $t_3$ has a **double** zero at $u_0$ (both F sites), so $t_3'(u_0)=0$ and the regularised operator $\\hat t_3(u_0)$ of $K_\\kappa$ is the second derivative $\\tfrac12t_3''(u_0)$; at finite $\\nu=\\theta_{F1}-\\theta_{F2}$ the datum $y_p$ is $O(\\nu)$ and is divided by the localisation constant $\\lambda_3\\propto\\nu$ inside $P_\\kappa$. (E = 20 is the singlet with $\\tau_F=+\\tfrac14$, E = 4 the one with $\\tau_F=-\\tfrac14$.)\n\n### 3.2 $\\mathbb A\\to K_1$\n\n$P_\\kappa$ is a polynomial in three normalised single-pair eigenvalues $A=\\tau_F/(h^2\\lambda_1)$, $B=\\tau_2(u_0)/(2h^4y\\lambda_2)$, $C=\\hat\\tau_3(u_0)/(6h^5y^2\\lambda_3)$, $P_\\kappa=s^2+\\kappa s(A+B+C)+\\kappa^2AC/4$, and at $\\varepsilon\\to0$ ($\\kappa\\to1$, $y\\to1$, $s\\to-1$, $\\lambda_k\\to(\\tfrac12,-\\tfrac18,\\tfrac38)$ with the vanishing factors dropped) the normalised eigenvalues converge to those of the untwisted operators. Hence $\\mathbb A\\to K_1=2-A-B-C$ **provided $\\hat\\tau_3$ is the regularised untwisted eigenvalue** (second-derivative operator above), and $A\\cdot C=4$ on the translation-invariant states. With $\\tau=\\tau_1(\\theta_F)$, $x=\\tau_1(\\theta_F+h)$, $\\tau_2(u_0)=x\\tau$ this gives the one-pair Q-formula\n$$\\mathbb A_0=K_1=2-8\\tau-\\frac1{2\\tau}+64\\,x\\,\\tau .$$\nThe next cell verifies it on the exact singlets, with the regularised $\\hat t_3$ built directly at the untwisted chain; the cell after it checks that the normalised $A,B,C$ of the twisted $\\varepsilon$-chain converge to the untwisted values.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 3.2 A -> K1: regularised untwisted hat t3(u0), K1 operator value on the exact singlets, A*C = 4, and the one-pair Q-formula *)\nqfK1chk = Module[{h = 1/2, ty = qfTy4, th = {1, 0, 1, 0}, I4 = IdentityMatrix[4], sec0 = qfZero, T3r, X3r, c, out},\n  T3r = qfT[3, I4, 1/2, ty, th, h, True]; X3r = Normal[T3r[[sec0, sec0]]];     (* hat t3(u0): all vanishing factors of the prefactor dropped (double zero) *)\n  c = {1, -8, 64, -128/9, 256/9};                                                  (* kappa = 1, y = 1: coefficients of {1, X1, X2, X3^, X3^ X1} *)\n  out = Table[Module[{psi = qfUntw[[j, \"psi\"]], p, X3, tau = qfUntwData[[j, \"tauF\"]], x = qfUntwData[[j, \"x\"]], A, B, C, K1},\n     p = First[Ordering[Abs[psi], -1]]; X3 = Simplify[(X3r . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]]];\n     A = 8 tau; B = -64 tau x; C = 128/9 X3; K1 = c[[1]] + c[[2]] tau + c[[3]] tau x + c[[4]] X3 + c[[5]] X3 tau;\n     <|\"E\" -> If[tau > 0, 20, 4], \"tauF\" -> tau, \"x\" -> x, \"hat t3\" -> X3, \"A\" -> A, \"B\" -> B, \"C\" -> C, \"A*C\" -> A C, \"K1\" -> K1, \"K1 = 2-A-B-C\" -> 2 - A - B - C, \"2 - 8 tau - 1/(2 tau) + 64 x tau\" -> 2 - 8 tau - 1/(2 tau) + 64 x tau|>], {j, 2}];\n  out];\nqfAlim = Table[{Round[N[Abs[qfLimE[[j, 3]]], 20]], N[Abs[qfLimE[[j, 3]]], 14]}, {j, 2}];\nColumn[{Grid[Prepend[Table[Values[r], {r, qfK1chk}], Keys[qfK1chk[[1]]]], Frame -> All],\n  Grid[{{\"extrapolated A (Part 2a), E = 20, E = 4\", qfAlim[[1, 2]], qfAlim[[2, 2]]}}, Frame -> All]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725117\" data-output-id=\"214\" data-out-n=\"156\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"49\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"11\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[156]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"24\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.9002em;vertical-align:-2.2001em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7001em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.7001em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.0951em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0951em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.0551em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.0551em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6102em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.5551em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0551em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.2151em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">E</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style