   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 3.3 [analytic derivation; exact on the singlets; hp on all 28 states]:** with $\\tau=\\tau_1(\\theta_F)$, $\\tau'=\\partial_u\\tau_1|_{\\theta_F}$ (untwisted, $h=\\tfrac12$)\n$$\\mathbb W\\ \\longrightarrow\\ B_1^2,\\qquad B_1=1+\\frac{\\tau+h\\tau'}{4h^4}+\\frac{\\tau^2}{16h^8}=1+4\\tau+2\\tau'+16\\tau^2 ,$$\nand $\\sqrt{\\mathbb W}\\to5$ ($E=20$: $\\tau=\\tfrac14,\\tau'=1$) and $3$ ($E=4$: $\\tau=-\\tfrac14,\\tau'=1$). The eigenvalue data of the twisted chain reproduce each ingredient: $\\nu y_{2,4}\\to\\mp\\tau/(4h^3)$ (so $y_s$ individually diverge like $1/\\nu$), $y_2+y_4\\to-3,-1$, $g\\,y_2y_4\\to1$, $B_{z_2},B_{z_3}\\to5,3$ (first table); on all 28 states the deviation $|\\mathbb W-B_1^2|/(1+|B_1^2|)$ is $\\le3\\cdot10^{-3}$ at $\\varepsilon=1/800$ and $\\le1.6\\cdot10^{-3}$ at $1/1600$ (halving with $\\varepsilon$). On the singlets (and only there) the parity relation gives $B_1=16\\tau^2-4\\tau-1+8x$.",
